 186:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_rcc.c ****  |               | 2.7 V - 3.6 V  | 2.4 V - 2.7 V  | 2.1 V - 2.4 V   | 1.8 V - 2.1 V   |
