 192:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_rcc.c ****  |2WS(3CPU cycle)|60 < HCLK <= 90 |48 < HCLK <= 72 |36 < HCLK <= 54  |32 < HCLK <= 48  |
