 194:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_rcc.c ****  |3WS(4CPU cycle)|90 < HCLK <= 120|72 < HCLK <= 96 |54 < HCLK <= 72  |48 < HCLK <= 64  |
